          <div class="aw-panel" id="awIssuePanel"></div>
          <div class="aw-panel" id="awAuthPanel"></div>
          <div class="aw-panel" id="awTopicsPanel"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="aw-foot">Ask Wakili gives general information only, grounded strictly in this firm's published Case Digest — it does not give legal advice and nothing you type is stored verbatim. For advice on your specific situation, <a href="contact.html" style="color:var(--cta);font-weight:600;">talk to an advocate</a>.</div>
